\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t<div class=\"c-news-list-item-extended c-news-list-item-extended--compact \">\r\n\r\n\t\t<div class=\"c-news-list-item-extended__media-container\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-news-list-item-extended__media\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" height=\"260\" src=\"/filtered/270103/rszww480h260-90/sagtorp-7--1358597855-rszww480h260-90.jpg\" width=\"480\" />\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"c-news-list-item-extended__content\">\r\n\t\t\t<a class=\"c-news-list-item-extended__title\" href=\"/valfard-skola/sagtorpsskolan/nyheter/2026/01/nyhet-ledighetsansokan-gors-nu-i-infomentor/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<h3>Nyhet! Ledighetsans&#246;kan g&#246;rs nu i InfoMentor!</h3>\r\n\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2026-01-27T09:57+00:00\" class=\"c-news-list-item-extended__timestamp\">\r\n\t\t\t\tPublicerad 27 januari 2026 klockan 10:57\r\n\t\t\t</time>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"c-news-list-item-extended__text\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t<div class=\"c-news-list-item-extended c-news-list-item-extended--compact \">\r\n\r\n\t\t<div class=\"c-news-list-item-extended__media-container\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-news-list-item-extended__media\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" height=\"260\" src=\"/filtered/288446/rszww480h260-90/generation_pep_skola_badge_2026--1414816665-rszww480h260-90.jpg\" width=\"480\" />\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"c-news-list-item-extended__content\">\r\n\t\t\t<a class=\"c-news-list-item-extended__title\" href=\"/valfard-skola/sagtorpsskolan/nyheter/2025/12/sagtorpsskolan-blir-certifierad-som-en-generation-pep-skola-2026/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<h3>S&#229;gtorpsskolan blir fortsatt certifierad som en Generation Pep Skola 2026!</h3>\r\n\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-12-12T10:28+00:00\" class=\"c-news-list-item-extended__timestamp\">\r\n\t\t\t\tPublicerad 12 december 2025 klockan 11:28\r\n\t\t\t</time>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"c-news-list-item-ext